====== Xunlong Orange Pi Zero (H2+) ======

Orange Pi Zero is a small form factor board H2+ based development board produced by Xunlong. More information: http://linux-sunxi.org/Xunlong_Orange_Pi_Zero

For further Allwinner-based boards, please refer to [[docs:techref:hardware:soc:soc.allwinner.sunxi|soc.allwinner.sunxi]]

{{:media:xunlong:orangepizero.jpg?250|}}


