==== Status ====

   * OpenWrt 19.07.0 has images with limited functionality (no WLAN, no i2c, etc.)
   * https://hyphop.github.io/mizy/ has a working implementation based on OpenWrt including WLAN, i2c, etc.
   * https://github.com/melsem/openwrt/ also has some patches for additional functionality for this board, including 1wire and WLAN

==== Availability ====

The board is available from various vendors, including the manufacturer itself, see [[http://www.orangepi.org/orangepizero/|here for Orange Pi Zero]].

