^ CPU/Speed        | 1.2 GHz                                                    |
^ Flash-Chip       | SPI                                                        |
^ Flash size       | 2 MB                                                       |
^ RAM              | 256MB/512MB DDR3 SDRAM(256MB version is Standard version   |
