^ USB              | 1x 2.0                                                     |
^ Serial           | [[#Serial|Yes]]                                            |
^ JTAG             | tbd                                                        |

==== Serial ====

The UART pins are located next to Ethernet jack on the board. They are marked as TX, RX and GND on the PCB. You can use your usual serial levelshifter.

How to connect to the Serial Port of this specific device:\\

